WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.086
Bystander available or alone.

00:00:02.086 --> 00:00:09.065
When another person is available, ask them to fetch an AED that is within about a 60-second walk.

00:00:09.065 --> 00:00:17.554
When you are the lone rescuer, stay with the casualty and begin compressions rather than leaving to search for an AED.
